  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/07/img_6447.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(30 fotos) El murciano Diego el Notario, acompa&ntilde;ado esta vez por el valenciano Maxi Rangel, han ofrecido la noche de este jueves divertidos mon&oacute;logos en Man&aacute; Bar, de la calle 8 de Marzo de Onda.&nbsp;Tras una suculenta cena a base de delciosas tapas, ha habido humor, una canci&oacute;n ir&oacute;nica y al final han acabado los dos improvisando a partir de las frases sugeridas por las personas asistentes, que han re&iacute;do a mand&iacute;bula suelta.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/monolegsoparmanabar/img_6421.jpg\" alt=\"img_6421\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/monolegsoparmanabar/img_6423.jpg\" alt=\"img_6423\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/monolegsoparmanabar/img_6424.jpg\" alt=\"img_6424\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/monolegsoparmanabar/img_6425.jpg\" alt=\"img_6425\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/monolegsoparmanabar/img_6426.jpg\" alt=\"img_6426\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/monolegsoparmanabar/img_6428.jpg\" alt=\"img_6428\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/monolegsoparmanabar/img_6430.jpg\" alt=\"img_6430\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/monolegsoparmanabar/img_6431.jpg\" alt=\"img_6431\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f2